Reason:
The bug occurs because the code attempts to log the file descriptor values using `fileno(this->urandom_fp)` and `this->fd` after the streams or file descriptors have already been closed. This results in invalid values being logged (specifically, `fileno()` returning -1), which complicates debugging.

