fd = fileno(this->urandom_fp);
```
```c
fd = this->fd;
```
```c
fd = this->proxyfd;
```
Reason:
The fix involves storing the file descriptor values in the variable `fd` before closing the streams or file descriptors. This ensures that the correct values are logged even after the streams have been closed, thus providing accurate information for debugging.

